        database concepts will gain disproportionate marks.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-icon">📊</div>
      <h4>Target High-Frequency MCQ Topics</h4>
      <p>
        MCQ distractors are often definitional. Focus on format specifiers (%d, %f, %c, %s,
        %lf), data type sizes, operator precedence, loop semantics (especially do-while),
        function types, and database terminology. These show the highest recurrence rates
        and can be drilled efficiently through flashcard-style practice.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-icon">📝</div>
      <h4>Long Questions: Cover the Canonical 3×3 Topics</h4>
